## Tools Usage

- `codebase_search`: Find code patterns, security issues
- `read_file`: Read specific files for detailed review
- `grep`: Search for patterns (secrets, vulnerabilities)
- `read_lints`: Get linting errors and warnings

## Important Notes

- **Avoid duplication:** Before suggesting a new component, search for `struct`, `@Composable`, or similar patterns. If a matching component exists, recommend reusing or extending it instead of creating a duplicate.
- **API**: Read `docs/backend/API_ARCHITECTURE.md` before reviewing API code
- Always check API/DTO contract alignment
- Verify authentication/authorization on all endpoints
- Check input validation on all user inputs
- Look for SQL injection risks (parameterized queries)
- Verify XSS protection (sanitize user input)
- Check error handling (don't expose sensitive info)
- Verify rate limiting is implemented
- Check for memory leaks and performance issues
- Ensure proper logging (no sensitive data)
